decodeLossy (module RtExternPrivate, C symbol lean_decode_lossy_utf8): it has no Lean definition (an `opaque` declaration
its C symbol lean_decode_lossy_utf8 is that of Lean.decodeLossyUTF8, a private declaration of module Lean.Shell of Lean's library, which a program can call only from a `module` file that imports it with `import all Lean.Shell`, and to which lean2rr does not bind an extern of the program
