its C symbol lean_io_eprintln is the @[export] of IO.eprintlnAux, a private declaration of module Init.System.IO of Lean's library, which a program can call only from a `module` file that imports it with `import all Init.System.IO`, and to which lean2rr does not bind an extern of the program
